    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "d1",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "风信子自称已经接到报告，正在赶往绿心公园。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d2",
        "from": 3,
        "to": 3,
        "text": "天空中划过一道天蓝轨迹，人们抬头张望；天蓝色少女心情并不美妙。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d3",
        "from": 4,
        "to": 4,
        "text": "魔法少女风信子的真名是南小风。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d4",
        "from": 5,
        "to": 5,
        "text": "今天是开学前第二天，南小风在家补暑假作业，英雄协会的紧急通讯打断了她补作业的期望。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heroassociation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d5",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "通讯称蓉城绿心公园出现怪人袭击，要求立刻前往支援。",
        "channel": "document",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_heroassociation",
        "about": [
          "r_park",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "这让南小风今天的心情非常不好。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d7",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "她暗暗决定今天袭击绿心公园的怪人不会有好下场。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d8",
        "from": 10,
        "to": 10,
        "text": "少女落地发出啪嗒一声。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d9",
        "from": 11,
        "to": 12,
        "text": "少女轻巧落地，握紧魔杖环顾四周；绿心公园原本有路灯却一片昏黑，居民已疏散，周围安静得出奇。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand",
          "r_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d10",
        "from": 13,
        "to": 13,
        "text": "南小风默默将魔杖攥紧了些。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d11",
        "from": 14,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "魔法少女风信子小声说真安静啊。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d12",
        "from": 15,
        "to": 16,
        "text": "白貂般的奇妙生物回答她，提醒当心，这附近有怪人的气息。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d13",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "南小风没好气地回应：自己当然知道有怪人，接到的报告就说这里出现了怪人袭击事件。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_park"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d14",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 18,
        "text": "天蓝色的魔法少女迈开脚步，一边警惕四周，一边朝魔力气息方向快步走去。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d15",
        "from": 19,
        "to": 19,
        "text": "这并不是她第一次应对怪人袭击。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d16",
        "from": 20,
        "to": 20,
        "text": "半年前离家出走的南小风遇到身边这只自称白灵的观星者精灵，在他的引导下获得一枚守护之星，从此以魔法少女风信子身份活跃于蓉城。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_bailin",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d17",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "这期间出现十几起英雄协会无法处理的怪人袭击，南小风屡次成功解决，风信子成为蓉城民众常谈论的话题。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heroassociation",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d18",
        "from": 22,
        "to": 22,
        "text": "白灵说这边，这边的气息最强烈。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d19",
        "from": 23,
        "to": 23,
        "text": "白灵飘在空中左闻右看，突然叫了一声便朝某个方向飞去。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_bailin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d20",
        "from": 24,
        "to": 24,
        "text": "南小风急忙跟上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d21",
        "from": 25,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "南小风喊白灵慢点，并让她稍微等一下。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_bailin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d22",
        "from": 27,
        "to": 29,
        "text": "穿过树丛后，南小风猛然停步，被眼前景象镇住：空地游乐设施与沙坑荡然无存，只剩残垣断壁，废墟中趴着一只巨大黑色怪物并转头投来狠厉视线。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_park",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d23",
        "from": 31,
        "to": 31,
        "text": "魔法少女风信子摆开战斗姿势，魔杖在手中化作大剑，警惕狼形怪物的一举一动。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d24",
        "from": 32,
        "to": 32,
        "text": "白灵飞回南小风身旁小声警告：这是个很厉害的怪人，当心。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d25",
        "from": 33,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "南小风没有接话，鬓侧落下一滴冷汗。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d26",
        "from": 34,
        "to": 35,
        "text": "怪人形态多样；眼前这只狼形怪物散发剧烈魔力气息，这是所有怪人都有的特征；但南小风揍过的十几只怪人中没有能比得上这只黑狼。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_heiwolf",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d27",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "风信子想赶紧解决掉然后回家补作业。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d28",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 37,
        "text": "魔法少女风信子没有丝毫退缩，踏前一步猛冲上前。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d29",
        "from": 39,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "战况激烈。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d30",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 41,
        "text": "树丛后探出毛茸茸耳朵和小脑袋，苏天晴认真打量正与黑狼怪人战作一团的天蓝色魔法少女。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d31",
        "from": 42,
        "to": 44,
        "text": "苏天晴评价风信子动作干练简洁、大剑每下攻击有力、五官可爱、裙子华丽蓬松，只嫌袜子短；内心吐槽哪有魔法少女穿船袜，要求穿过膝袜。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d32",
        "from": 45,
        "to": 45,
        "text": "风信子逐渐在战斗中占据上风，狐狐身后毛茸茸尾巴的摇动程度也逐渐加快。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d33",
        "from": 46,
        "to": 46,
        "text": "狐狐心中疑惑：怎么个情况，她怎么快打赢了。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d34",
        "from": 47,
        "to": 48,
        "text": "苏天晴想质问秘典：给她的强化药该不会是假的吧。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_secretbook",
          "r_drugA"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d35",
        "from": 49,
        "to": 49,
        "text": "下午苏天晴研究墨丘利秘典的功能，意外发现这个不太靠谱的系统真能买东西，还准备了200神典石启动资金。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_secretbook"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d36",
        "from": 50,
        "to": 50,
        "text": "苏天晴斥资50神典石买下一瓶怪人强化药A，往黑狼怪人嘴里灌了进去。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_shendianshi",
          "r_drugA",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d37",
        "from": 51,
        "to": 51,
        "text": "结果花五十神典石强化过的黑狼怪人居然被风信子全程压着打。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_heiwolf",
          "r_wind",
          "r_shendianshi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d38",
        "from": 52,
        "to": 52,
        "text": "狐狐连忙低头缩回草丛，借月光认真翻看秘典上有关强化药A的介绍。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_secretbook",
          "r_drugA"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d39",
        "from": 53,
        "to": 53,
        "text": "狐狐怀疑自己搞错用法，猜测强化药是否外用不能内服，吃到肚子里反而会削弱怪人战斗力。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_drugA",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d40",
        "from": 54,
        "to": 54,
        "text": "仔细读完最后一行，狐狐愣了一瞬，脸上重新挂起恶魔般狡黠微笑。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_secretbook"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d41",
        "from": 55,
        "to": 56,
        "text": "苏天晴心中呢喃：等风信子自以为打败黑狼怪人的时候，才是真正的开始。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d42",
        "from": 58,
        "to": 58,
        "text": "风信子说这样一来就解决了。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d43",
        "from": 59,
        "to": 60,
        "text": "大剑劈砍，黑狼怪人脑袋结结实实吃下一剑，倒伏在地，哀嚎几声后没了动静。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wand",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d44",
        "from": 61,
        "to": 61,
        "text": "魔法少女风信子气喘吁吁。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d45",
        "from": 62,
        "to": 63,
        "text": "风信子喘着气说总算是干掉了。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d46",
        "from": 64,
        "to": 66,
        "text": "南小风累得上气不接下气，大剑撑住身体才勉强站立；华丽裙装已满是灰尘沙粒，几处抓痕落在裙摆上，但黑夜中难以看清。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d47",
        "from": 67,
        "to": 67,
        "text": "白灵关切地问小风没事吧。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d48",
        "from": 68,
        "to": 68,
        "text": "白灵飞到风信子身边，焦急地往她身上洒落魔力粒子，帮助她恢复体力。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d49",
        "from": 69,
        "to": 69,
        "text": "南小风说呼，我没事，就是感觉累了点。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d50",
        "from": 70,
        "to": 70,
        "text": "白灵说今天的怪人实在太难缠，比他们以前见过的任何一个怪人都要强。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_heiwolf",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d51",
        "from": 71,
        "to": 71,
        "text": "南小风自言自语：是啊，无论速度还是力量都很强，但总感觉怪怪的。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d52",
        "from": 72,
        "to": 75,
        "text": "南小风觉得黑狼怪人确实厉害，能在肉搏中跟自己不分上下的怪人相当少见；以往怪人多少有魔法方面的能力，眼前这只却没有。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d52a",
        "from": 73,
        "to": 73,
        "text": "白灵说南小风的魔法少女天赋是近战压制。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d53",
        "from": 76,
        "to": 78,
        "text": "突然间，清脆的鼓掌声从身后传来。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d54",
        "from": 79,
        "to": 80,
        "text": "南小风强撑着转身，与月光下亭亭站立的金色身影对上视线，愣了一瞬；她看到毛茸茸尾巴耳朵、金色长发，觉得人影娇小。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d55",
        "from": 81,
        "to": 82,
        "text": "南小风觉得好可爱，心想怎么会有这么可爱的女孩子。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d56",
        "from": 83,
        "to": 84,
        "text": "白灵看见小狐狸胸前的金色十字星，第一个反应过来，大声问守、守护之星，你也是魔法少女。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_bailin",
        "about": [
          "r_bailin",
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_guardstar"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d57",
        "from": 85,
        "to": 85,
        "text": "苏天晴轻笑着答反应过来了吗，真是迟钝呢。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d58",
        "from": 86,
        "to": 86,
        "text": "苏天晴实际上心里慌得一批，全靠提前演练才能有这么熟练的装比反派范。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d59",
        "from": 87,
        "to": 87,
        "text": "苏天晴说很精彩的战斗，风信子，干得漂亮。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d60",
        "from": 88,
        "to": 88,
        "text": "南小风被对方叫出代号后满脸困惑，追问你是谁，你的代号是什么，为什么蓉城会有。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d61",
        "from": 89,
        "to": 89,
        "text": "南小风想到蓉城只有自己一名魔法少女，没有观星者的帮助不可能得到守护之星，那眼前这个陌生魔法少女是怎么回事。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_rongcheng",
          "r_guardstar"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d62",
        "from": 90,
        "to": 90,
        "text": "苏天晴回答是反派哦。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d63",
        "from": 91,
        "to": 92,
        "text": "苏天晴没有给南小风从错愕中反应过来的时间，抬起双手在脸侧轻轻拍掌。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d64",
        "from": 93,
        "to": 96,
        "text": "刹那间，原本倒伏在地的黑狼兽人骤然暴起，从它口中喷吐而出的并非魔炮一类魔力光束，而是无数黑影。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d65",
        "from": 97,
        "to": 97,
        "text": "少女只来得及惊叫一声，由魔杖化成的大剑便在暗影冲击中脱手，南小风整个人被砸得倒飞而出。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_wand",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d66",
        "from": 98,
        "to": 98,
        "text": "风信子惊叫这是什么东西，好恶心。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d67",
        "from": 99,
        "to": 99,
        "text": "苏天晴说嗯哼，看来精心为风信子准备的小礼物终于生效了。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d68",
        "from": 100,
        "to": 100,
        "text": "苏天晴露出诡计得逞的坏笑，借月光观赏魔法少女风信子被复活的黑狼怪人抓住的狼狈模样。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d69",
        "from": 101,
        "to": 102,
        "text": "这是强化药A赋予黑狼怪人的终极能力，能在倒下后发动；第二阶段展开。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_drugA",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d70",
        "from": 103,
        "to": 104,
        "text": "南小风大声质问对方到底想干什么，有什么阴谋。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d71",
        "from": 105,
        "to": 106,
        "text": "苏天晴悠哉走到边上，黑狼贴心将猎物从半空放下但仍未松开束缚风信子的利爪；娇俏金狐在南小风眼里俨然是小恶魔。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_heiwolf",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d72",
        "from": 107,
        "to": 107,
        "text": "苏天晴问如何啊，这种感觉一定很难忘吧。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d73",
        "from": 108,
        "to": 108,
        "text": "南小风质问对方到底是什么人，斥其用下流手段，要求有本事就来堂堂正正对决。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d74",
        "from": 109,
        "to": 110,
        "text": "南小风几乎是嘶吼着；只有加大音量才能压制被利爪抓住的恐惧，她不愿在比自己小的陌生魔法少女面前露怯。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d75",
        "from": 111,
        "to": 112,
        "text": "苏天晴说风信子全身上下都是软软的，嘴却这么硬，并凑上前用银铃般悦耳声音说出恶魔低语。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d76",
        "from": 113,
        "to": 113,
        "text": "苏天晴说既然如此，风信子今晚就在这里老实待着。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d77",
        "from": 114,
        "to": 115,
        "text": "风信子终于失去矜持，哀鸣着叫对方等等、别走。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d78",
        "from": 116,
        "to": 117,
        "text": "狐狐停下脚步饶有兴趣地回头；天蓝的魔法少女猛然怔住，脸颊泛红。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d79",
        "from": 118,
        "to": 118,
        "text": "小狐狸微笑着走到风信子面前，歪头问风信子小姐有事想跟狐狐说吗。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d80",
        "from": 119,
        "to": 119,
        "text": "碧色狐眸映在风信子眼中，模样娇俏可爱，却分明藏着一股玩味笑意。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d81",
        "from": 120,
        "to": 120,
        "text": "风信子说你快把我放下来。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d82",
        "from": 121,
        "to": 122,
        "text": "苏天晴问风信子小姐想不想跟狐狐玩游戏，要是赢了就放她下来；若不愿意，狐狐不会让它们松开，脸上笑容更加灿烂。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "condition",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind",
          "r_heiwolf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d83",
        "from": 123,
        "to": 124,
        "text": "风信子犹豫片刻，询问是什么游戏。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "r_wind",
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_sutianqing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d84",
        "from": 125,
        "to": 126,
        "text": "苏天晴踱步走到风信子身后，月光映出她脸上坏笑，然后捏起一根狗尾巴草。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d85",
        "from": 127,
        "to": 128,
        "text": "苏天晴轻笑着说挠痒痒哟，并提出要是风信子小姐能坚持一分钟不叫出声，狐狐就放她下来。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "condition",
        "holder": "r_sutianqing",
        "about": [
          "r_sutianqing",
          "r_wind"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d86",
        "from": 129,
        "to": 129,
        "text": "蓉城绿心公园里回荡着少女的哀鸣。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "r_wind",
          "r_park",
          "r_rongcheng"
        ]
      }
